message.content:
{
"version": "1",
"text": "You will wear a tailored chocolate blazer with the long sleeves left down, a light blue satin skirt that flows to your calves, and beige ankle boots with a pointed toe. The outfit is anchored by a delicate silvery lariat necklace resting at your collarbone and a soft white brooch pinned to the left lapel of your blazer for a touch of festive charm. Over this ensemble, you have chosen a long chocolate coat with a matching belt to wrap around your waist, bringing warmth and structure against the frosty autumn air.",
"how_to_wear": [
"Leave the collar of the blazer flat when indoors so the neckline remains open, or raise it slightly over the evening for added warmth without losing elegance."
],
"wrong_photos": [],
"swap": {},
"named": [],
"about_items": [
{
"n": "#502·11",
"text": "This is a structured blazer in a rich chocolate hue, cut with clean lines and a double-breasted front. Its sleeves are long and tailored to frame your arms, while the lapels sit close to the neck to elongate the silhouette."
},
{
"n": "#129·17",
"text": "A light blue satin skirt that falls to mid-calf, offering a smooth, fluid line that contrasts beautifully with the sharp tailoring of your top. Its subtle sheen catches the light without being overly bright, keeping the look refined for an evening event."
},
{
"n": "#32·15",
"text": "These are beige ankle boots with a sleek pointed toe and a moderate heel that elevates your posture while remaining comfortable enough for hours of standing. The narrow shaft hugs the ankle, creating a seamless transition into the skirt."
},
{
"n": "#319·31",
"text": "A fine silvery chain necklace designed as a lariat with a small teardrop pendant that rests gently at your chest. Its minimalist form adds a layer of sophistication without overwhelming your neckline."
},
{
"n": "#542·17",
"text": "A brooch shaped like a knitted white rose, attached to the left lapel of your blazer. Its soft texture and pale color provide a gentle contrast against the deep brown fabric, adding a personal and delicate detail."
},
{
"n": "#83·19",
"text": "A structured crossbody bag made from glossy red leather with a subtle crocodile embossing. The bold color acts as an accent that draws the eye, while its rectangular shape offers practical space for your essentials at the event."
},
{
"n": "#393·34",
"text": "A long coat in the same chocolate shade as your blazer, featuring wide lapels and a matching belt to define the waist. The heavy fabric and length provide both warmth and an elongating line that complements the outfit’s vertical emphasis."
}
]
}
